OL,3,GNEWSAMan in hospital after crashing
OL,4,Ainto pub's wall
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver in his 20s has been taken to
OL,7,Fhospital after crashing into the wall
OL,8,Foutside a pub.
OL,10,FWiltshire Police said officers were
OL,11,Fcalled to the crash involving a
OL,12,FVolkswagen Polo outside the Old Lane
OL,13,Fpub in Pewsham at 20:10 BST on
OL,14,FThursday.
OL,16,FAbout 50 people were inside the pub
OL,17,Ftaking part in its weekly quiz at the
OL,18,Ftime of the incident.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
